{"unit_id":"fanghedeng__dsh-skill-gogo#card-zh","repo":"fanghedeng/dsh-skill-gogo","commit":"937b28196bc25ed5f37939aef598da3dfd170bed","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Skill GoGo 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的技能管理插件，通过侧边栏面板和对话输入区菜单连接宿主的技能服务。用户可以浏览、搜索和预览可用技能，创建分类并调整颜色与顺序，也能把技能调用写入输入框或复制到剪贴板。它还支持将本地技能打包下载、复制到项目目录、管理额外技能目录及重命名本地技能，适合希望集中整理和复用 DSH 技能的用户。使用时需要安装在 DSH profile 中；插件不要求额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1983-1996","lib/index.js:637-668","lib/index.js:753-805"]}
{"unit_id":"fanghedeng__dsh-skill-gogo#card-en","repo":"fanghedeng/dsh-skill-gogo","commit":"937b28196bc25ed5f37939aef598da3dfd170bed","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Skill GoGo adds a skill panel and composer menu to DSH web. Browse, search, and preview skills; organize categories; insert skill calls; export local skills as ZIP files; copy them into projects; manage extra directories; and rename local skills. Install in a DSH profile; no API key is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1983-1996","lib/index.js:637-668","lib/index.js:753-805"]}
